  "prefLabel": "Env-A 401.01 Purpose",
  "priorExpiration": "1997-05-09",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 401.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to implement RSA 125-D, the Acid Rain Control Act, so as to reduce the adverse effects of acid deposition on ecosystems and public health by reducing sulfur dioxide (SO2) emissions from sulfur-emitting sources within New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #120, eff 8-31-73; ss by #721.5, eff 12-7-75; ss by #718, eff 12-7-75; ss by #1717, eff 2-19-81; ss by #2332, eff 4-29-83; ss by #2938, eff 12-27-84; ss by #5033, eff 12-27-90; EXPIRED 12-27-96\n\nNew. #6424, INTERIM, eff 1-9-97, EXPIRES 5-9-97; ss and moved by #6469-B, eff 3-5-97 (from Env-A 406); ss by #8233, eff 12-22-04, ss by #10288, eff 3-19-13; ss by #13641, eff 5-23-23",
